    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Shares
    of our Class A Common Stock are listed on The Nasdaq Capital Market under the symbol &ldquo;SIDU.&rdquo; There is no established
    trading market for the Warrants, and we do not expect a trading market to develop. We do not intend to list the Warrants on any securities
    exchange or other trading market. Without a trading market, the liquidity of the Warrants will be extremely limited.</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

